 * Odd vs. Even Length:
   * Even Length (e.g., [1, 2, 3, 4]): Pointers cross cleanly (left exceeds right).
   * Odd Length (e.g., [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]): Pointers meet at the exact center (left == right), and the loop terminates safely.
